                    to the Assistant Secretary of State for American Republic Affairs (Braden).</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d452-f2" n="23" xml:id="d452-f2-content">
                <p>Hubert F. Havlik, Acting Chief of the Division of Investment and Economic
                    Development, and Jerome J. Stenger of the same Division.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d452-f3" n="24" xml:id="d452-f3-content">
                <p>A marginal comment reads: “This is right move. S. B[raden].”</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
